<p><b>Voice notes explained properly, and a proper hello.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The Reviewer Guide now shows what makes voice notes special: talk while you scrub and playback drives the picture — for everyone. Figures included, plus how session minutes ask before your mic joins.</li>
<li>A brand splash at cold launch — Asobi Review × AUTONOMY — gone in just over a second.</li>
</ul>
